<title>GREECE: ATHENS BOURSE OKS SPYROU-AGRICULTURE IPO.</title>
<headline>ATHENS BOURSE OKS SPYROU-AGRICULTURE IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the initial public offering prospectus of Spyrou Agriculture AEBE for listing on its small-cap parallel market.</p>
<p>Spyrou Agriculture which markets seeds used in agriculture will issue 750,000 new common bearer shares with a par value of 100 drachmas.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
